Short:        Examples to start programming with TinyGL
Author:       mathias.p@wanadoo.fr (Mathias 'Corto' Parnaudeau)
Uploader:     mathias p wanadoo fr (Mathias \\'Corto\\' Parnaudeau)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      0.1
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

						
Date    : 08/06/03

Given examples have a increasing difficulty, so it's perfect for
learning OpenGL with this nice TinyGL library.

You need a C compiler (GCC, SAS/C). The GCC TinyGL lib doesn't seem
to work with VBCC however.
 
